## 🖧 UART Command Reference

| Command | Example | Description                                               |
| ------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| `S`     | `S`     | Start control loop                                        |
| `P`     | `P`     | Pause control loop                                        |
| `T`     | `T`     | Toggle telemetry streaming (CSV)                          |
| `R<n>`  | `R1`    | Switch to DE5 parameter row n                             |
| `Q`     | `Q`     | Query current DE5 state (I_target, V_command, active row) |

**Telemetry format (if ON):**

```
<rotor_angle>,<measured_current>,<V_command>,<I_target>\r\n
```

